summary.label:
Ramadan 2023 Guide is a seeker of Islamic Adan times and alerts with notifications of timely offerings of namaz. 

Salat Time is a complete guide for namaz, Adhan, displaying the time of the next namaz and timely accurate notifications of the remaining time of the next namaz. 

You can easily find the nearest mosque or Masjed with this Qiblah locator and accurate prayer times. You can use this Muslim prayer time to pray anywhere in the world to pinpoint the exact direction of the qiblah. 


Key Features:
- Shows prayer times for Fajr, Zuhr, Asr, Maghrib, Isha, and optional times for Imsak, Sunrise, Duha, Midnight and Qiyam;
- Multiple calculation methods;
- Notification and reminder settings for prayer time;
- Reminder before the time;
- Qiblah Compass;
- Islamic Hijra calendar;

Ramadan 2023: Qibla & Prayers is the most comprehensive guide to namaz times, qibla directions, and Azan alarms available to Muslims around the world.

Using this app, you can receive notifications of prayers based on your location, and you can also set individual prayer times by comparing the azan times at the nearest mosque.

Qibla directional compass retrieves north, south, east and west directions with latitude and longitude information. Wherever you go, the app automatically detects your location and provides azan information based on your region.

Key features of the app:
- Prayer times and qibla direction;
- Mobile Auto Silent Time;
- Daily ayat notification;
- Today's ayat, today's dua, today's hadith;
- Listen to the 99 names of Allah and details;
- Prayer times, sunrise and sunset.
